<!-- =====================================
STORYTELLING KNOWLEDGE
===================================== -->

<section class="form-section">

<h2 class="section-title">
📚 Storytelling Knowledge
</h2>

<p class="section-description">
These questions help us understand your current knowledge of storytelling.
</p>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="povDefinition">
What is Point of View (POV)?
</label>

<textarea
id="povDefinition"
name="Understanding of POV"
rows="5"
placeholder="Explain what POV means in storytelling..."
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="bestPov">
Which POV do you understand best?
</label>

<select id="bestPov" name="Preferred POV" required>

<option value="">Select POV</option>
<option>First Person</option>
<option>Second Person</option>
<option>Third Person Limited</option>
<option>Third Person Omniscient</option>
<option>Multiple POV</option>
<option>I'm still learning about POV</option>

</select>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="effectiveDialogue">
What makes dialogue effective?
</label>

<textarea
id="effectiveDialogue"
name="Effective Dialogue"
rows="5"
placeholder="What makes conversations between characters feel good to read?"
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="pacing">
What is pacing, and why is it important?
</label>

<textarea
id="pacing"
name="Understanding of Pacing"
rows="5"
placeholder="Explain what pacing means to you..."
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="chapterEnding">
What makes a chapter ending effective?
</label>

<textarea
id="chapterEnding"
name="Effective Chapter Ending"
rows="5"
placeholder="What makes a reader want to open the next chapter?"
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="plotVsStory">
What do you think is the difference between a plot and a story?
</label>

<textarea
id="plotVsStory"
name="Plot vs Story"
rows="5"
placeholder="Explain the difference in your own words..."
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="continueReading">
What makes a reader want to continue reading?
</label>

<textarea
id="continueReading"
name="Reader Retention"
rows="5"
placeholder="What keeps readers coming back for another chapter?"
required></textarea>

</div>

</section>


<!-- =====================================
WRITING CAPACITY
===================================== -->

<section class="form-section">

<h2 class="section-title">
⚡ Writing Capacity & Consistency
</h2>

<p class="section-description">
Litdom writers need to be able to produce consistently while maintaining the quality of their work.
</p>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="chaptersPerWeek">
How many chapters can you realistically produce per week?
</label>

<select id="chaptersPerWeek" name="Chapters Per Week" required>

<option value="">Select an option</option>
<option>1 – 2 chapters</option>
<option>3 – 5 chapters</option>
<option>6 – 10 chapters</option>
<option>11 – 15 chapters</option>
<option>More than 15 chapters</option>

</select>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="usualChapterLength">
What chapter length do you usually write?
</label>

<input
type="text"
id="usualChapterLength"
name="Usual Chapter Length"
placeholder="e.g. 800 – 1,200 words"
required>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="writingSchedule">
How consistently can you maintain your writing schedule?
</label>

<textarea
id="writingSchedule"
name="Writing Schedule Consistency"
rows="5"
placeholder="Tell us about your realistic writing routine..."
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="productionChallenge">
What is your biggest challenge when trying to produce chapters consistently?
</label>

<textarea
id="productionChallenge"
name="Writing Consistency Challenge"
rows="5"
placeholder="What usually affects your consistency?"
required></textarea>

</div>

<div class="input-group">

<label for="qualityUnderPressure">
How do you maintain quality when working under a tight writing schedule?
</label>

<textarea
id="qualityUnderPressure"
name="Quality Under Pressure"
rows="5"
placeholder="Tell us how you balance speed and quality..."
required></textarea>

</div>

</section>


